  "id": "delusional-system",
  "term": "delusional system",
  "definition": "A delusional system is a fixed, lasting pattern of false beliefs, such as feeling persecuted or believing a partner is unfaithful, that does not change despite evidence. It can develop gradually while a person otherwise keeps clear, organized thinking, with emotions and behavior fitting the delusional beliefs.",
